*> SORT and MERGE run their INPUT and OUTPUT PROCEDUREs as PERFORM does.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SORTP.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT WORK-FILE ASSIGN TO "WORK".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
SD  WORK-FILE.
01  WORK-REC    PIC X(10).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    SORT WORK-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY WORK-REC
        INPUT PROCEDURE IS LOAD-RECORDS
        OUTPUT PROCEDURE SHOW-FIRST THRU SHOW-LAST
    STOP RUN.
LOAD-RECORDS.
    MOVE "B" TO WORK-REC
    RELEASE WORK-REC.
SHOW-FIRST.
    RETURN WORK-FILE AT END CONTINUE END-RETURN.
SHOW-LAST.
    DISPLAY WORK-REC.
